# 🛡️ Home SIEM with Wazuh

## 📖 Project Overview

This project demonstrates the deployment of a Home Security Information and Event Management (SIEM) lab using Wazuh on Ubuntu Server running in VirtualBox.

The purpose of this lab is to gain hands-on experience in security monitoring, log collection, endpoint management, and incident detection within a simulated Security Operations Center (SOC) environment.

---

## 🎯 Objectives

- Deploy Ubuntu Server in VirtualBox
- Install and configure Wazuh
- Connect Windows endpoints
- Monitor security events
- Analyze Windows Event Logs
- Detect suspicious activity
- Learn SOC analyst workflows

---

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

- Ubuntu Server
- Wazuh
- VirtualBox
- Windows
- Linux
- Sysmon (Coming Soon)



